Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cutting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nets me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about 60,000 yen a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that kidney I just\Nsold was, uh, 1.2 mil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My right eye was 300,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sold one of my nuts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much did they go for again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a hundred K, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, as of today, I owe...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over 38 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, Pochita?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready to kill something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:02:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most devils ain't what you'd call good,\NBut a dead one's good for about 300 thou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunting devils is easily the\Nbest way to make some cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.97,0:03:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be the tomato devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.90,0:03:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn the seeds or it'll use them\Nto come back for round two .
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.83,0:04:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, excellent work, Denji.\NSomeone on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is bound to pay a hefty sum\Nfor this fresh corpse how's 400
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,000 sound to you sounds\Nawesome that 's before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,subtracting your debt payment and interest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though which whittles it down to 170\N000 then there's the finder's fee
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,admin fee management costs\Nand so on just 70k left for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me i definitely gotta use\Nthis cut to pay the water bill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there are the debts\Ni still owe to other
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people funny how that\Nworks we're already down to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1800 yen pochita there's\Nnothing to eat back at our
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place which means we have to make this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1800 yen last the rest\Nof the month for dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tonight let's go full-on\Ncarbivore and split a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slice of bread okay i\Nreally don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why you hire a punk like\Nthat to take out devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's to ensure he pays off the\Nmountain of debt he owes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though his worthless dead dad accrued\Nit, Denji's the one stuck with the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is a broke-ass kid and\Nhis creepy little pet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honestly the best fit\Nfor this sort of job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Authentic devil hunters\Nwouldn't do what Denji does.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dealing the carcasses of their kills to\Nthe Yakuza is too scandalous for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Denji's biggest perk\Nis how obedient he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey Fido, I'll give you a\Nhundred yen if you swallow the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cigarette, huh? Whoa, he will all\Nrighty down the hatch, this sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goes we'll be in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,touch keep in mind your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pig slop if you try to skip town
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:06:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're set
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for another
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three days guess
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what i found out recently\Nit's considered normal to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eat your bread with jam on\Nit hmm too bad normal's a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pipe dream for folks down on\Ntheir luck like us bet that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll bite the big one before\Ni ever pay off this debt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,probably won't kick it with a girl before\Ni kick the bucket either my rinky-dink
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shack doesn't exactly scream\Nromance no dough to go on dates
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if dreams do come
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,true and before i croak\Ni want to be with a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:07:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cowardly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bastard strung
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,himself up before paying this month's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,installment look kid i don't\Ncare if you beg or whore yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out i want 700
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,000 yen by tomorrow otherwise we\Nchop you up and sell the bits got it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chainsaw
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,devil hurry up and do it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're gonna kill\Nme i'm dead either way
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death's coming for both of us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that by drinking blood, devils\Ncan heal whatever wounds they've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to die, then bite me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My blood doesn't come free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're signing a contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I helped you out and saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because, like you, I'd rather not die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hire me as a devil hunter\Nso I can pay off what I owe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm way too hungry to sleep right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think about money when I can't sleep,\Nwhich makes falling asleep even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I do cop some Z's, I know\Nwhat dream I want to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonna put jam on all my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bread, split every piece with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll lay on the charm\Nand flirt with a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll spend the night playing video games
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together and hug each\Nother as we doze off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just runs in my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said my mom died from a heart\Ncondition that made her cough up blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a new devil for you, Denji.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.95,0:10:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a devil
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,showed up in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apart from us, I don't see a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.77,0:10:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's hiding somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:11:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it made like\Na bird and flocked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Denji,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my boy You know we're grateful\Nfor your years of service, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as loyal and obedient as a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to top it off, you work for\Ncheap treats like one as well. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only problem with dogs is I\Ncan never tolerate the stench.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Yakuza may be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powerful, but even the ones on top\Ndream of getting bigger and richer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we took a page from your book\Nand struck a deal with the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:12:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wanted to obtain demonic power\Nand see ourselves grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whereas I want to see every\Ndevil hunter in existence perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you, little devil hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've met rungs that were\Nsmarter than these louts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such gullible fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I offered them a shred\Nof my demonic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.51,0:12:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they willingly handed that\Nfreedom to me on a silver pl atter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little do they know the power they\Nsought would turn them into zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I'm the zombie devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you really should have chosen an\Noccupation that doesn't butcher my kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because now I have to butcher you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go mindless minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear them apart and toss every\Npiece you collect into the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:13:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I was asking to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be freaking king of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just dreaming of a normal life\Nis enough to keep me going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.19,0:13:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't even get to have that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:14:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a long day ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 99.9% positive I'm gonna\Ndie fighting a devil someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my one regret will be\Nleaving you on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you can't feed yourself\Nand just starve to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or another devil hunter\Nslaughters you in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some devils in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world that can take over\Ndead bodies, or so I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.79,0:15:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you happen to be one of them, Pochita,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby give you full permission\Nto take whatever's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait until after I'm buried, though,\Nso the Yakuza won't be on your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you could up and leave\Nthis town and be ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to live a normal\Nlife and die a normal death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll live out the dreams I never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:16:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took my body like I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always loved listening to\Nyou talk about your dreams, Denji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a new contract for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, you're getting my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In exchange, show me your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still alive after\Nbeing cut to ribbons?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:16:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repulsive freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.19,0:17:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate devil hunters because of how\Nresistant you are. Go ahead and eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see him bounce\Nback from being devoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys had plenty\Ngoing for them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it they wanted even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we're alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orchid had made me happy, and\Nthat should have been enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I kept on dreaming of a better life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we all fantasize\Nabout getting an upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't really say I blame you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dreaming's not a bad thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna get it, I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating is bound to keep\Nthat rock dead for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the front of a devil you were\Nwith take control of your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare budge from that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are, you freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.23,0:19:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.89,0:19:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.07,0:20:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys went full devil Right down\Nto your twisted greedy little hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.69,0:20:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm out here tonight\Nbecause you said you had a job
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for me I'm on the clock So I\Nshould kill you devils dead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you jerk the worm\Nfood, it's bye-bye, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't know what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone beat us to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like that one there is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your scent is rather peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's neither a human's nor a devil's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, this your handiwork?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.63,0:22:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, will you hold me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.87,0:22:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any indication\Nthat he's been possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.21,0:22:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be written all over\Nhis face if he were just so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a Public Safety Devil Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.47,0:22:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to kill the zombie devil that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:22:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either you die by my\Nhand as a depraved devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.01,0:23:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you let me keep you as a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the record, my pets\Nget delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious food, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's on the breakfast menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.20,0:23:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bread with butter and jam is\Nalways a given at my table.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coffee and salad's also good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, maybe dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like one of my best\Ndreams ever just came true.
